  id: SeaLampLighthouse
  displayName: Lamp Lighthouse
  description: 'A banded tower with an oil lamp behind a ground-glass lens. Beam:
    23 tiles. Its beam guides your boats (they fish more and come home safely), speeds
    ships along, keeps pirates off your sea routes, and burns raiders'' and pirates''
    hulls.'
